[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0678","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0678.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0925","title":"SmartWin CyberOffice Shopping Cart 2.0 敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"SmartWin CyberOffice Shopping Cart 2.0（又名 CyberShop）存在敏感信息泄露漏洞。该软件的默认安装将 `_private` 目录权限设置为全局可读，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过 HTTP 直接访问该目录下的敏感文件，获取数据库配置、用户订单等机密信息。该漏洞影响 CyberOffice Shopping Cart 2.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。建议用户修改 `_private` 目录的访问权限或部署 Web 应用防火墙进行防护。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0925"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:46.800","remediation":"将 `_private` 目录权限改为 750 或更低（仅允许管理员可读），或删除该目录下不必要的信息文件。如使用 Apache，在 `_private` 目录中放置 `.htaccess` 文件添加 `Deny from all` 规则以禁止 Web 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q4/0001.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97050819812055&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1734","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5318","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20248","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c729733510a7fb9b2cb302c6d8fbcecf1fc7ba0f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0925.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0925","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0925.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cd9d7030fbc42684ccfa32eb6cd959ffcadf351/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0925.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cwvq-94g9-4qc4/GHSA-cwvq-94g9-4qc4.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0925.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--54e9cbaf-4404-4a33-88ff-4e605b84edc2.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idinfor"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0678.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0678.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0678.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0676","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0676.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0924","title":"Armada Design Master Index 1.0 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Armada Master Index 1.0 的 search.cgi CGI 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 \"catigory\" 参数提交包含 \"..\"（点点）序列的恶意请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，可导致敏感信息泄露。Exploit-DB 已公开该漏洞的利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0924"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:46.660","remediation":"由于 Armada Design Master Index 1.0 已停止维护，官方不再提供补丁。建议在 search.cgi 中对 \"catigory\" 参数进行严格过滤，移除 \"../\" 等目录遍历字符序列，并限制仅允许访问指定目录下的文件。更彻底的方案是替换为仍受支持的 Web 应用或自行重写 search.cgi 脚本，在代码层面使用白名单机制限定可访问文件路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0141.html","http://www.osvdb.org/461","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1772","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5355","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20277","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0924.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/c