UM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0921"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:46.263","remediation":"建议升级到 Hassan Consulting Shopping Cart 1.19 或更高版本（已修复目录遍历漏洞）。若无法升级，需在 shop.cgi 中对 page 参数实施严格输入验证：限制仅允许字母数字字符，禁止使用 ../ 等路径遍历序列，并使用 chroot 或安全路径拼接函数将文件访问限制在指定购物车目录内。同时在 Web 服务器层面配置目录访问控制，禁止 CGI 脚本访问应用目录以外的文件系统路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0115.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1596","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1777","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5342","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20281","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5a47a98d3cbc3520c61de6e48feeb4ac3ff1959f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0921.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0921","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6e9e95bdf54c62e7299472e01ae8f57ecac16ab9/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0921.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/36b31680a85f0a9de2a7a097ce138d0bf67458bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0921.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6be15d5bc4d11c3f9dbcc76b2b68361cadc22974/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7v65-28xp-w7r5/GHSA-7v65-28xp-w7r5.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/d6ee32836c8c11eb01df26c01cf81cde62b02041/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0921.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0672.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0670","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0670.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0920","title":"BOA Web Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"BOA Web Server 0.94.8.2 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向服务器发送特制的 GET 请求，使用 \"%2E\"（即 URL 编码的点号）替代普通 \".\" 符号构造路径穿越序列，即可绕过服务器对目录遍历的检测，实现任意文件读取。该漏洞可导致服务器敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、密码文件等），严重威胁系统安全。由于攻击复杂度低且无需任何权限，该漏洞在互联网上被广泛利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0920"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:46.130","remediation":"建议立即将 BOA Web Server 升级至 0.94.14 或更高版本（该系列最终修复版本），或彻底更换为仍在维护的 Nginx/Apache Web 服务器。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理，过滤包含 `%2e` 等编码路径遍历特征的 GET 请求，或在 BOA 源码中手动禁用 `../` 及 URL 编码变种的路径解析。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0092.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001009","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1770","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5330","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36689","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1ba39e3ba737b838bba789f1cc5a339b5a2399ad/2000/CVE-2000-0920.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3619c6454232bc86bc1c5ee6d49baecbff394f3b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0920.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0920","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2000/CVE-2000-0920.rules","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/web-applications/23494.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f8615defb985bab445eb5487b411802098cc3657/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0920.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0920.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-xj3m-j93c-rfwv/GHSA-xj3m-j93c-rfwv.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/httpd_boa.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0670.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0669","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0669.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0919","title":"PHPix Photo Album 目录遍历漏洞","description":"PHPix Photo Album 1.0.2 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过在 URL 中构造包含 `..`（点点斜杠）序列的恶意请求，绕过目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件，如配置文件、密码文件等敏感信息。该漏洞源于程序对用户输入的文件路径参数缺乏充分的过滤与校验，攻击条件简单，危害较大，可导致敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0919"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:46.000","remediation":"PHPix Photo Album 1.0.2 及更早版本已停止维护，建议立即替换为其他仍在维护的相册程序（如 Piwigo）。若无法替换，在 PHP 入口文件中添加输入过滤：`if (strpos($_GET['file'], '..') !== false) { die('Invalid request'); }`，同时在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）配置中禁止 URL 中包含 `../` 的请求。将 `open_basedir` 限制为仅允许 Web 目录访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0117.html","http://www.osvdb.org/472","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1773","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5331","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20278","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c7415a52c8c7c49b12758f6cb68d7d41d1190b12/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0919.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0919","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/581b673c344d829d047fea0ed051c916f949df9f/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0919.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e77750