缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在网络边界路由器上启用 ARP 速率限制（arp-rate-limit），将每秒 ARP 请求数阈值调低以缓解洪水攻击的影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0078.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1592","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1759","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5340","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20271","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e2b7e39540f8003a5fc1c3ce83959dcdba6671a4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0914.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0914","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a62a80fdc2396b876bbf0b9654bdb65410ca206f/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0914.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/17761d0bb7d0c679e07e3a6bd812f9ec07c3dd92/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0914.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-43g6-p2gr-59p7/GHSA-43g6-p2gr-59p7.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0914.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0914.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0df5d8ae-0caf-4369-b33e-064e72bd9337.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0666.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0665","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0665.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0912","title":"MultiHTML CGI 脚本文件泄露漏洞","description":"MultiHTML 1.5 的 CGI 脚本存在路径遍历文件泄露漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向\"multi\"参数传入任意文件路径（如../../etc/passwd），读取目标服务器上的敏感文件内容。该漏洞影响安装了 MultiHTML 1.5 的 Web 服务器，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。攻击者无需凭据即可远程利用，在特定配置下还可能通过该漏洞执行任意命令，导致服务器被完全控制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0912"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:44.943","remediation":"立即升级到 MultiHTML 最新可用版本，或替换为维护良好的替代方案（如 thttpd 内置索引功能）。若无法立即升级，应在 Web 服务器配置中禁用该 CGI 脚本的执行权限，或通过.htaccess 限制仅允许特定目录访问。同时修改 multihtml.c 源码，对 multi 参数进行严格过滤，移除 '/'、'..' 等路径分隔符，设定文件访问白名单，并将 Web 服务器运行用户权限降级至最低限度，禁止读取系统敏感文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0146.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5285","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22204","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24762ffc4408618d0c62379d258b248e81056dc1/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0912.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0912","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0912.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8305d7f6f9031873a5609178b8b2d4422836eee7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0912.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xgm2-6pvq-chh4/GHSA-xgm2-6pvq-chh4.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/multihtml.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0912.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/multihtml.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0665.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0664","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0664.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0909","title":"华盛顿大学 Pine 邮件客户端 From 字段缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"华盛顿大学 Pine 4.21 及更早版本的邮件客户端在自动邮件检查功能中未对 From 头部字段进行长度校验，存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送携带超长 From: 头的特制电子邮件，利用该漏洞在受害系统上触发缓冲区溢出并执行任意命令，从而完全控制受影响的邮件客户端所在主机。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0909"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:44.540","remediation":"立即升级 Pine 邮件客户端至 4.21_1 或更高版本（FreeBSD 用户从 ftp.freebsd.org 获取更新包后重新安装）。若无法立即升级，可临时卸载 pine4 包或避免让 Pine 在后台保持打开邮箱文件夹的状态以降低风险。考虑迁移至 Alpine（Pine 的后续维护版本）以获得持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0441.html","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-073.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-102.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/84901","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1709","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5283","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20237","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0909.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0909","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0909.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0909.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/unreview