危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0906"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:44.133","remediation":"建议立即升级 Moreover cached_feed.cgi 至 4.July.00 之后的修复版本，或彻底移除该 CGI 脚本。若无法升级，请在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache mod_rewrite 或 Nginx location 配置）对 category 与 format 参数进行严格路径穿越过滤，拦截包含 `..`、`../` 等路径遍历序列的请求；同时配置 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截目录遍历攻击载荷，并限制 CGI 脚本对文件系统的访问权限至最小必要目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0013.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1762","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5334","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20273","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0906.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0906","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0906.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0906.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g743-m34x-3m6h/GHSA-g743-m34x-3m6h.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1762/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0906.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_iddirtra"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0661.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0659","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0659.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0904","title":"QSSL Voyager 2.0 1B 目录信息泄露","description":"QSSL Voyager 2.0 1B 网络服务器在演示磁盘版本中存在目录信息泄露漏洞。其 web 文档根目录下的 .photon 文件夹存储了敏感的 Web 客户端信息，包括用户认证凭证和配置细节。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可直接访问该目录，通过普通 HTTP 请求获取敏感信息，导致用户信息泄露和潜在的安全风险。该漏洞影响 Windows、Linux 等平台，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，已在 2000 年 12 月的补丁更新中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0904"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:43.850","remediation":"建议立即升级至 QNX Neutrino RTOS 6.5 或更高版本（已停止支持 QNX 4.x），并迁移至现代 Web 服务器（如 nginx/Apache）。若必须维持旧系统，请立即删除 Web 文档根目录下的 .photon 目录，并在 Web 服务器配置中添加规则拒绝访问所有以点开头的隐藏目录（如 Apache 配置：<Directory ~ \"^\\.\"> Require all denied </Directory>），同时在防火墙层面限制 Web 服务仅允许可信 IP 访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/79956","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1648","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20207","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0904.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0904","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0904.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0904.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-53jm-6fjm-h945/GHSA-53jm-6fjm-h945.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0904.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1648/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_infor.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0659.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0659.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0659.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0657","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0657.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0903","title":"QSSL Voyager 2.0 1B 目录遍历漏洞","description":"QSSL Voyager 2.0 1B Web 服务器（QNX 405 演示磁盘中包含的 Voyager 2.01B 版本）存在目录遍历漏洞。远程未经身份验证的攻击者可通过构造包含 \"..\" (点点) 序列的 HTTP 请求路径，绕过 Web 根目录限制，遍历服务器文件系统并读取任意文件内容。该漏洞源于 Web 服务器对用户提交的路径参数缺乏规范化校验，未对 \"..\" 序列进行过滤或规范化处理。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，仅需发送包含目录遍历序列的 HTTP GET 请求即可读取服务器上任意可读文件（如系统配置文件、源代码、敏感数据等），CVSS 评分 5.0 (MEDIUM)，影响机密性。QSSL (QSSL Inc.) 已停止对该版本的支持，受影响版本为 Voyager 2.01B (QNX 405 Demo disks 版本)。攻击者可通过构造类似 `GET /../../etc/passwd HTTP/1.0` 的请求实现任意文件读取。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0903"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:43.710","remediation":"建议立即升级 QSSL Voyager Web 服务器至 2.01B 之后的修复版本（建议升级至 QNX 4.25 后续补丁版本或迁移至 QNX 6.x 以上版本）。若无法立即升级，请立即删除或禁用 Voyager 演示磁盘中的 Web 服务组件，并在 Web 服务器配置中启用路径规范化检查以阻止 ../ 路径遍历攻击。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器前端部署 WAF 规则拦截包含 ../ 或 ..\\\\ 的请求路径，并在防火墙层面限制 Web 服务端口（默认 80/8080）仅对可信 IP 开放。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/79956","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1648","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20206","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0903.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0903","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ce5427cb8e1ae5cac2424f252caacc35a9a0cdaa/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0903.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0903.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p43f-q89p-7fm6/GHSA-p43f-q89p-7fm6.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0903.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1648/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_iddirtra"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0657.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0657.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0657.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0655","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0655.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0901","title":"GNU Screen 终端复用器 格式字符串漏洞","description":"GNU Screen 3.9.5 及更早版本的 vbell_msg 初始化变量中存在格式化字符串漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在该变量中注入格式化字符（如 %n、%s 等），利用格式化字符串漏洞破坏栈内存，进而提升权限获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 GNU Screen 3.9.5 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 4.6（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），攻击向量为本地访问，攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，可导致机密性、完整性、可用性部分受损。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，通过设置恶意的 vbell_msg 环境变量或配置参数，诱导 screen 程序处理格式化字符串，实现任意代码执行并提权至 root。Jürgen Weigert 维护的 screen 终端复用器在处理可视铃铃消息时未正确验证格式化字符串，导致该漏洞存在。官方已在后续版本中修复，建议升级至修复版本或限制本地用户对 screen 配置的写入权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0901"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:43.420","remediation":"建议升级到 screen 3.9.6 或更高版本（如 3.10），此版本修复了 vbell_msg 变量的格式字符串漏洞。立即安装最新稳定版 screen 软件包。临时缓解措施：设置 TTY 设备文件权限为 600 并限制用户可访问的设备数量，阻止攻击者通过格式字符串利用 vbell_msg 初始化变量获取 root 权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0530.html","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/updates/MDKSA-2000-044.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/adv6_draht_screen_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-058.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/80178","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1641","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5188","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20191","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0901.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0901","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0901.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0901.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-rvv8-fhqp-59jg/GHSA-rvv8-fhqp-59jg.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0901.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b7